{"id":"ausflug","lemma":"Ausflug","pos":"noun","rank":2652,"glosses":["excursion, outing, short trip"],"ipa":"/ˈʔaʊ̯sfluːk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/De-at-Ausflug.ogg/De-at-Ausflug.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Ausfluges","plural":"Ausflüge"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie ist auf einem Ausflug.","en":"She's gone on a trip.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Lasst uns einen Ausflug machen.","en":"Let's take a trip.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393701","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Er sagte den Ausflug ab.","en":"He called off the trip.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"beginning at that time…"}]},{"text":"Ich hätte Lust auf einen Ausflug.","en":"I feel like taking a trip.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"desire"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Du solltest deinen Ausflug absagen.","en":"You should cancel your trip.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to cancel, to call off"}]}]}